    networkObjectiveTitle:"01 · Objective and analysis question",networkObjectiveText:"Describe how each team organises ball circulation and identify passing relationships between players.",networkQuestion:"How does each team organise ball circulation, and which passing relationships emerge between players?",
    networkContextTitle:"02 · Context and configuration",networkContextText:"Full Côte d’Ivoire–Nigeria match, MATCH_ID 3923881, using StatsBomb Open Data. Eight players per team were selected by passing involvements.",networkConfig1:"Networks and maps use completed passes.",networkConfig2:"Filtered network threshold: at least three passes per direction.",networkConfig3:"Full network without a threshold among the eight selected players.",networkConfig4:"Node size represents player involvement.",networkConfig5:"Pass start and end maps use a common scale.",
